 "title": "The blitz: sending extra rushers is a gamble",
 "html": "<p><strong>What it is:</strong> normally four defenders rush the QB and seven cover receivers. A <strong>blitz</strong> sends a fifth or sixth rusher, usually a linebacker or DB, to reach the QB faster.</p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 226\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A six-man blitz: a linebacker and the nickelback join the four linemen rushing the quarterback, leaving the slot receiver open on a quick throw\"><defs><marker id=\"m16w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m16y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"130\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"125\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><path d=\"M100 138 L100 108 L124 86\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m16w)\"/><path d=\"M194 184 L130 92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m16w)\"/><path d=\"M186 96 L197 178\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m16y)\"/><path d=\"M108 112 L188 184\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m16y)\"/><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"134.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"134.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"134.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"134.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"134.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"146\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"149.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"144\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"147.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"150\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"153.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"144\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"147.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"192\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"195.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"234\" cy=\"192\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"234\" y=\"195.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"116\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"163\" y=\"119.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"191\" cy=\"116\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"191\" y=\"119.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"219\" cy=\"116\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"219\" y=\"119.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"247\" cy=\"116\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"247\" y=\"119.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"116\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"119.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"116\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"119.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"84\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"245\" y=\"87.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"34\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"37.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"34\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"37.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"84\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"87.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"104\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"107.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">NB</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"66\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">open: the NB left this spot</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"184\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">LB + NB rush too:</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"198\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#F2B705\">6 rushers</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"216\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">QB throws \"hot\" fast</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\">The linebacker and nickelback join the four linemen. The slot receiver the nickelback was covering is now alone, so the QB throws to him right away.</p>\n<p><strong>The payoff:</strong> a sack, a rushed throw or an interception. Sunday night Denver sacked Matthew Stafford four times, and the pressure led to Talanoa Hufanga's interception, returned 66 yards for a touchdown.</p>\n<p><strong>The risk:</strong> every extra rusher is one fewer defender in coverage. If the QB throws quickly to the spot the blitzer left (a \"hot\" throw), that receiver is open with nobody behind him. That's how the Rams answered minutes later with a 48-yard touchdown to Konata Mumpfield.</p>\n<p><strong>How to spot it on TV:</strong> before the snap, count defenders standing within a couple of yards of the line. More than four, especially linebackers creeping forward or a DB walking down from the slot, usually means a blitz. Then watch the QB: a quick throw beats it; holding the ball gets him hit.</p>\n<p><strong>The betting link:</strong> Steelers at Browns has the lowest total of the week, meaning the market expects few points. In low-scoring games, final margins tend to be small, so getting 2.5 points (Browns +2.5) is worth more than it would be in a shootout. Blitz-heavy defenses that force punts are part of why the total is low.</p>\n<p class=\"note\">Next: how a defense decides what to do before every snap.</p>",
